{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Has gone up</b> — concerning the Ark that was hidden, that it shall go up and appear. And others said the reason: for HaShem will subdue the peoples beneath us, and when we sound the teru'ah over them with trumpets and shofar sound, HaShem will go up from it; therefore they called [Him] Elyon."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:31:04.786335342Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}